# InterGenOS — open-vm-tools default-enable preset.
# Enables vmtoolsd by default so VMware guests get timesync + dynamic resize
# out of the box. Sorts before 99-intergenos-default-disable.preset's
# `disable *` catch-all, so this explicit rule wins (systemctl preset-all is
# first-match-wins in lexical filename order). Safe to enable globally: the
# unit carries ConditionVirtualization=vmware, so it is inert on bare metal,
# VirtualBox, and KVM/QEMU.
enable vmtoolsd.service
